  unitName: Swiftshot Andaria
  unitId: 830135
  unitNumber: 8060
  description: Andaria was created by the old gods, birthed from the elements of
    earth and air. She is a demi-god with exceptional combat intelligence and a master
    of the bow. She could draw and shoot faster than any common man with a gun. Before
    the war, Andaria specialized in researching the past and putting a history on
    their civilization origins. When the war broke out, she vowed to protect the
    holy lands where the first demi-gods were created. As the flames of war continue
    to burn, Andaria working under Ultor's command stands guard at the sanctuary
    protecting the ancient grounds.
  summonDesc: Aid me in protecting the sacred lands!
  fusionDesc: I grow more powerful with each hunt!
  evoDesc: You can run, but you can't hide!
